# .mailmap — one canonical identity per contributor.
#
# Collapses the many name/email combos in git history so `git shortlog`,
# `git blame`, GitHub, and release-drafter attribute each commit to the right
# person. Git reads this file from the repo root automatically.
#
# Canonical emails below use each person's known address. Swap in their real
# @telotia.com address once confirmed (pattern: firstname.lastname@telotia.com).
#
# Format:  Canonical Name <canonical-email> <commit-email-to-map>

